<aside class="priority-note" aria-label="September 13 lighting setup">
    <strong>September 13 · Two lights installed</strong>
    <p>
        On September 13, the AW200 and AeroLight 240 W were installed as two horizontal fixtures,
        one above the other in the bird's-eye plan. The AW200 ran at 45% and the AeroLight at 38%,
        with an 18-inch plant-tip reference and a 13 h 15 m total cycle including 15-minute sunrise
        and sunset transitions. Four hooks allowed independent leveling. Divider Mylar remained in
        place, while the two-foot room-end return reflector was removed. This arrangement covered
        the wood table and near half of the glass table. Exact clock times for that cycle were not
        recorded; the calendar below preserves the earlier ramp schedule.
    </p>
